const PB_GUIDES={"ko": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"폿 브레이커 RE, 깅코트리 브레이커, 플로어 브레이커의 조작법과 실제 승리 규칙을 설명합니다.\"><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ko\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/en/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ja\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/ja/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/zh/about\"><title>게임 가이드와 조작법 | CBZP POT BREAKER</title><style>\n:root{font-family:system-ui,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;color:#29365c;background:#d9efff}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;line-height:1.65;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#d3edff,#fff8e7 60%,#e5f4ff)}\na{color:#27518d}a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #cb7930;outline-offset:3px}\n.top{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px clamp(12px,4vw,40px);background:#fffaf0;border-bottom:3px solid #405879}\n.brand{font-weight:950;text-decoration:none;color:#243b65;letter-spacing:.04em}.top nav,.languages{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.top nav a,.languages a{padding:5px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:#e8f3ff;text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:800}.languages a[aria-current]{background:#ffd875}\nmain{max-width:1020px;margin:auto;padding:24px clamp(14px,4vw,32px) 60px}.intro{padding:clamp(20px,5vw,42px);border:3px solid #405b8b;border-radius:22px;background:#fffaf0;box-shadow:0 7px 0 #8a9fbd}.eyebrow{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#a34d4f}\nh1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.2rem);line-height:1.15;margin:.1em 0 .35em}h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);line-height:1.25;margin:0}h3{margin:1.2em 0 .35em;font-size:1.12rem}p{margin:.5em 0 1em}.intro p:last-child{font-size:1.1rem;max-width:760px}\n.jump{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin:22px 0}.jump a{padding:9px 15px;background:#fff;border:2px solid #5476aa;border-radius:99px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:850}\n.guide{scroll-margin-top:18px;margin:22px 0;padding:clamp(18px,4vw,32px);background:#fffdf8;border:2px solid #8da8cd;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 5px 0 #9db5d455}.section-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:2px solid #d9e4f1}.section-head p{margin:.3em 0 0;color:#435477}.num{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#ffdb7b;border:2px solid #415482;font-weight:950}\n.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.two>div{padding:2px 15px;border-radius:13px;background:#f0f6ff}.two h3{margin-top:.6em}ol,ul{padding-left:1.4em}li{margin:.38em 0}.note{padding:11px 14px;border-left:5px solid #d9a857;background:#fff2d3}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:540px}th,td{padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #afc3da;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}thead{background:#dcecff}tbody th{background:#f2f7ff;white-space:nowrap}.play{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;padding:11px 17px;border:2px solid #4b5d83;border-radius:13px;background:#ffd879;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #8295b2;color:#213456;text-decoration:none;font-weight:950}\ndetails{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d4dfec}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:850}details p{padding-left:14px}footer{padding:22px;text-align:center;background:#c4e4fa;color:#31466e}\n@media(max-width:700px){.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.top{align-items:flex-start}.top nav{width:100%}.top nav a{padding:4px 8px}.guide{padding:17px}.section-head{align-items:flex-start}}\n</style></head><body><div class=\"top\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\">♟ CBZP · POT BREAKER</a><nav aria-label=\"Site\"><a href=\"/\">게임으로</a><a href=\"/about\" aria-current=\"page\">플레이 방법</a><a href=\"/privacy\">개인정보·광고</a></nav><div class=\"languages\" aria-label=\"Languages\"><a href=\"/about\" aria-current=\"page\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</a> <a href=\"/en/about\" lang=\"en\">English</a> <a href=\"/ja/about\" lang=\"ja\">日本語</a> <a href=\"/zh/about\" lang=\"zh\">中文</a></div></div><main>\n<header class=\"intro\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">CBZP · POT BREAKER</p><h1>게임 가이드와 조작법</h1><p>세 게임은 같은 캐릭터가 등장하지만 목표와 조작이 다릅니다. 처음 플레이한다면 아래에서 게임을 고른 뒤, 해당 규칙을 읽어 보세요.</p></header>\n<nav class=\"jump\" aria-label=\"게임별 안내\"><a href=\"#pot\">폿 브레이커 RE</a><a href=\"#ginkgo\">깅코트리 브레이커</a><a href=\"#floor\">플로어 브레이커</a><a href=\"#faq\">자주 묻는 질문</a></nav>\n<section id=\"pot\" class=\"guide\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><div><h2>폿 브레이커 RE</h2><p>기묘를 움직여 사무실 미로의 크다 부장과 대결합니다.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"two\"><div><h3>시작과 조작</h3><p>시작 화면에서 난이도를 고르고 사무실로 입장합니다. 컴퓨터에서는 방향키 또는 WASD로 움직이고, Space로 화분을 던지며, Shift로 3칸 대시합니다. 대시는 사용 후 3초가 지나야 다시 쓸 수 있습니다. 터치 화면에는 방향 버튼과 던지기·대시 버튼이 표시됩니다. 방향 버튼을 누르고 있으면 계속 이동합니다.</p></div><div><h3>화면에서 볼 것</h3><p>왼쪽에는 기묘의 체력과 화분 수, 오른쪽에는 크다 부장의 상태가 표시됩니다. 화분을 던지기 전 남은 수를 확인하세요. 사무실 파티션은 길을 막으므로 상대와의 직선 거리만 보고 돌진하면 막힐 수 있습니다.</p></div></div>\n<h3>처음 시도할 때</h3><ol><li>먼저 파티션 사이의 통로를 살피고, 퇴로가 있는 위치로 움직입니다.</li><li>상대와 거리를 유지하다가 공격 방향이 열렸을 때 화분을 던집니다.</li><li>막다른 길에 들어가면 대시로 빠져나올 수 있는 방향을 미리 확인합니다.</li></ol><p class=\"note\">승패는 화면의 체력과 공격 결과로 정해집니다. 난이도별 상대 행동은 달라질 수 있으니 게임 안의 현재 표시를 기준으로 판단하세요.</p><a class=\"play\" href=\"/\">폿 브레이커 RE 플레이 →</a></section>\n<section id=\"ginkgo\" class=\"guide\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><div><h2>깅코트리 브레이커</h2><p>60초 동안 은행나무의 열매를 골라 점수를 모으는 반응 게임입니다.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"two\"><div><h3>열매를 고르는 법</h3><p>모바일에서는 손가락으로, 컴퓨터에서는 마우스로 노란 은행 열매를 선택합니다. 연속으로 맞히면 콤보가 이어집니다. 잎을 누르면 콤보가 끊기고, 썩은 은행을 누르면 잠시 입력할 수 없습니다. 열매처럼 보이는 모든 칸을 무작정 누르기보다 현재 칸의 모습을 확인하는 편이 좋습니다.</p></div><div><h3>제한 시간과 난이도</h3><p>한 판은 60초입니다. NORMAL, HARD, VERY HARD 중 난이도를 고를 수 있습니다. 어려운 난이도에서는 빠르게 바뀌는 칸을 읽는 데 집중해 보세요. 시간이 끝나면 점수와 최고 연속 성공 기록이 표시됩니다. 랭킹 등록은 결과 화면에서 직접 선택할 수 있습니다.</p></div></div>\n<h3>점수를 올리는 순서</h3><ol><li>노란 열매의 위치를 확인한 뒤 누릅니다.</li><li>잎과 썩은 열매를 피하며 콤보를 이어 갑니다.</li><li>입력이 잠겼다면 연타하지 말고 다음 열매가 보일 때 다시 시작합니다.</li></ol><a class=\"play\" href=\"/ginkgo\">깅코트리 브레이커 플레이 →</a></section>\n<section id=\"floor\" class=\"guide\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><div><h2>플로어 브레이커</h2><p>11×11판의 네 진영이 가운데 왕을 차지하고 지키는 난투체스입니다.</p></div></div>\n<p>각 진영은 폰 6개, 나이트 3개, 퀸 1개로 시작합니다. 선공은 무작위입니다. 한 차례에는 말 하나를 움직입니다. AI 세 명과 대전하거나 같은 기기에서 네 명이 차례로 둘 수 있습니다. 온라인 매칭은 없습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"two\"><div><h3>승리 조건</h3><p>중앙의 왕은 보통 폰으로 차지합니다. 30바퀴가 모두 끝났을 때 왕을 보유한 진영이 승리합니다. 30바퀴째에 왕이 비어 있으면 누군가 차지할 때까지 연장합니다. 왕을 가진 말이 공격받으면 왕은 다시 중앙으로 돌아갈 수 있으므로, 왕을 얻은 뒤에도 호위가 필요합니다.</p></div><div><h3>한 턴의 흐름</h3><p>내 말을 누르면 이동 가능한 칸이 초록 점으로, 공격 가능한 칸이 붉은 테두리로 나타납니다. 이동할 칸을 누르면 차례가 넘어갑니다. 게임판 위의 상태줄에서 현재 차례와 남은 바퀴를, 오른쪽에서 왕 보유 진영과 남은 말을 확인합니다. 한 행동의 제한 시간은 10초입니다.</p></div></div>\n<h3>말의 역할</h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>말</th><th>이동</th><th>공격과 왕</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>폰</th><td>8방향 1칸</td><td>인접한 폰·퀸과 왕을 가진 말을 공격할 수 있습니다. 중앙 왕을 차지하는 기본 말입니다.</td></tr><tr><th>나이트</th><td>8방향 최대 2칸</td><td>폰과 나이트를 잡습니다. 기본 규칙으로는 왕을 차지하거나 퀸을 공격하지 못합니다.</td></tr><tr><th>퀸</th><td>8방향 최대 2칸</td><td>왕을 가진 말을 나이트로, 나이트를 폰으로 강등합니다. 퀸은 공격한 칸으로 이동하고, 강등된 말은 가까운 빈칸으로 밀립니다.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"note\">왕을 가진 말은 폰을 공격할 수 없고 나이트·퀸을 공격할 수 있습니다. 퀸이 왕 보유자를 강등하면 왕은 중앙으로 돌아갑니다. 중앙 칸이 막혔다면 가까운 빈칸에 놓입니다.</p>\n<h3>캐릭터 능력</h3><ul><li><strong>기묘:</strong> 폰 또는 나이트의 이동 거리를 두 배로 늘리고 적을 뛰어넘습니다. 한 게임에 두 번 사용합니다. 폰의 공격 거리는 여전히 인접 1칸입니다.</li><li><strong>크다:</strong> 폰 하나로 인접한 적을 연속 공격합니다. 한 번 사용합니다.</li><li><strong>이 대리:</strong> 내 말과 내 폰의 자리를 교체합니다. 한 번 사용합니다.</li><li><strong>호 사원:</strong> 퀸을 희생해 나이트가 왕을 차지하게 합니다. 한 번 사용합니다.</li></ul>\n<p>가운데 근처에는 보이지 않는 가호 아이템도 있습니다. 한 턴 더 움직이기 4개와 폰 추가 2개가 숨어 있습니다. 왕을 가진 진영은 가호를 받을 수 없으며 아이템은 그 자리에 남습니다.</p><a class=\"play\" href=\"/floor\">플로어 브레이커 플레이 →</a></section>\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"guide\"><h2>자주 묻는 질문</h2><details><summary>게임을 설치해야 하나요?</summary><p>세 게임 모두 브라우저에서 열 수 있습니다. 폿 브레이커 RE와 깅코트리 브레이커는 실행 시 게임 엔진 파일을 내려받으므로 첫 로딩에 시간이 걸릴 수 있습니다.</p></details><details><summary>친구와 온라인으로 대전할 수 있나요?</summary><p>플로어 브레이커는 AI 대전 또는 같은 기기 4인 대전을 지원합니다. 온라인 매칭은 제공하지 않습니다.</p></details><details><summary>랭킹에 내 이름이 자동으로 올라가나요?</summary><p>폿 브레이커 RE와 깅코트리 브레이커의 랭킹 등록은 결과 화면에서 선택하는 방식입니다. 기록과 광고에 관한 설명은 <a href=\"/privacy\">개인정보 및 광고 안내</a>에서 확인하세요.</p></details></section>\n</main><footer>CBZP · POT BREAKER · <a href=\"/privacy\">개인정보·광고</a></footer></body></html>", "en": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"A practical guide to the controls, scoring and win conditions in Pot Breaker RE, Ginkgo Tree Breaker and Floor Breaker.\"><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/en/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ko\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/en/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ja\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/ja/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/zh/about\"><title>Game guides and controls | CBZP POT BREAKER</title><style>\n:root{font-family:system-ui,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;color:#29365c;background:#d9efff}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;line-height:1.65;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#d3edff,#fff8e7 60%,#e5f4ff)}\na{color:#27518d}a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #cb7930;outline-offset:3px}\n.top{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px clamp(12px,4vw,40px);background:#fffaf0;border-bottom:3px solid #405879}\n.brand{font-weight:950;text-decoration:none;color:#243b65;letter-spacing:.04em}.top nav,.languages{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.top nav a,.languages a{padding:5px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:#e8f3ff;text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:800}.languages a[aria-current]{background:#ffd875}\nmain{max-width:1020px;margin:auto;padding:24px clamp(14px,4vw,32px) 60px}.intro{padding:clamp(20px,5vw,42px);border:3px solid #405b8b;border-radius:22px;background:#fffaf0;box-shadow:0 7px 0 #8a9fbd}.eyebrow{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#a34d4f}\nh1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.2rem);line-height:1.15;margin:.1em 0 .35em}h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);line-height:1.25;margin:0}h3{margin:1.2em 0 .35em;font-size:1.12rem}p{margin:.5em 0 1em}.intro p:last-child{font-size:1.1rem;max-width:760px}\n.jump{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin:22px 0}.jump a{padding:9px 15px;background:#fff;border:2px solid #5476aa;border-radius:99px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:850}\n.guide{scroll-margin-top:18px;margin:22px 0;padding:clamp(18px,4vw,32px);background:#fffdf8;border:2px solid #8da8cd;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 5px 0 #9db5d455}.section-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:2px solid #d9e4f1}.section-head p{margin:.3em 0 0;color:#435477}.num{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#ffdb7b;border:2px solid #415482;font-weight:950}\n.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.two>div{padding:2px 15px;border-radius:13px;background:#f0f6ff}.two h3{margin-top:.6em}ol,ul{padding-left:1.4em}li{margin:.38em 0}.note{padding:11px 14px;border-left:5px solid #d9a857;background:#fff2d3}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:540px}th,td{padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #afc3da;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}thead{background:#dcecff}tbody th{background:#f2f7ff;white-space:nowrap}.play{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;padding:11px 17px;border:2px solid #4b5d83;border-radius:13px;background:#ffd879;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #8295b2;color:#213456;text-decoration:none;font-weight:950}\ndetails{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d4dfec}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:850}details p{padding-left:14px}footer{padding:22px;text-align:center;background:#c4e4fa;color:#31466e}\n@media(max-width:700px){.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.top{align-items:flex-start}.top nav{width:100%}.top nav a{padding:4px 8px}.guide{padding:17px}.section-head{align-items:flex-start}}\n</style></head><body><div class=\"top\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/en\">♟ CBZP · POT BREAKER</a><nav aria-label=\"Site\"><a href=\"/en\">Games</a><a href=\"/en/about\" aria-current=\"page\">How to play</a><a href=\"/en/privacy\">Privacy &amp; ads</a></nav><div class=\"languages\" aria-label=\"Languages\"><a href=\"/about\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</a> <a href=\"/en/about\" aria-current=\"page\" lang=\"en\">English</a> <a href=\"/ja/about\" lang=\"ja\">日本語</a> <a href=\"/zh/about\" lang=\"zh\">中文</a></div></div><main>\n<header class=\"intro\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">CBZP · POT BREAKER</p><h1>Game guides and controls</h1><p>The same characters appear in three different games. Each has a different objective. Choose a game below to learn what to watch before you play.</p></header>\n<nav class=\"jump\" aria-label=\"Guide sections\"><a href=\"#pot\">Pot Breaker RE</a><a href=\"#ginkgo\">Ginkgo Tree Breaker</a><a href=\"#floor\">Floor Breaker</a><a href=\"#faq\">Questions</a></nav>\n<section id=\"pot\" class=\"guide\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><div><h2>Pot Breaker RE</h2><p>Guide Gimyo through an office maze and face Director Keuda.</p></div></div><div class=\"two\"><div><h3>Getting started</h3><p>Choose a difficulty and enter the office. On a computer, use the arrow keys or WASD to move, Space to throw a plant pot, and Shift to dash three squares. Dash has a three-second cooldown. On a touch screen, use the direction buttons and the throw and dash controls. Hold a direction to keep moving.</p></div><div><h3>Reading the screen</h3><p>Gimyo's health and remaining pots appear on the left; Keuda's status appears on the right. Check your supply before throwing. The office partitions block routes, so a direct line toward the opponent is not always a path you can take.</p></div></div><h3>A useful first approach</h3><ol><li>Find a route with room to retreat before closing the distance.</li><li>Keep moving until an attack lane opens, then throw a pot.</li><li>Before entering a dead end, identify a direction you can dash back out.</li></ol><p class=\"note\">The live health and attack indicators determine the outcome. Enemy behavior can vary with difficulty, so follow the current in-game display.</p><a class=\"play\" href=\"/en\">Play Pot Breaker RE →</a></section>\n<section id=\"ginkgo\" class=\"guide\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><div><h2>Ginkgo Tree Breaker</h2><p>A 60-second reaction game about picking the right fruit.</p></div></div><div class=\"two\"><div><h3>What to tap</h3><p>Tap yellow ginkgo fruit with a finger or click it with a mouse. Consecutive correct picks build a combo. A leaf breaks that streak, and a rotten fruit briefly locks input. Check the current appearance of each square instead of tapping every moving object.</p></div><div><h3>Time and difficulty</h3><p>A run lasts 60 seconds. Choose NORMAL, HARD, or VERY HARD. At the end, the game shows your score and best combo. You can choose whether to submit a ranking entry from the result screen.</p></div></div><h3>A steadier scoring rhythm</h3><ol><li>Identify the yellow fruit before tapping.</li><li>Avoid leaves and rotten fruit to keep the combo going.</li><li>If input is locked, wait for the next clear target rather than tapping repeatedly.</li></ol><a class=\"play\" href=\"/ginkgo/en\">Play Ginkgo Tree Breaker →</a></section>\n<section id=\"floor\" class=\"guide\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><div><h2>Floor Breaker</h2><p>Four teams compete for the crown on an 11×11 board.</p></div></div><p>Each team starts with six pawns, three knights, and one queen. The first player is random. Move one piece per turn. You can face three AI teams or share one device with three other players. There is no online matchmaking.</p><div class=\"two\"><div><h3>How to win</h3><p>A pawn normally claims the neutral crown in the center. The team holding it at the end of 30 complete rounds wins. If the crown is unclaimed then, play continues until a team claims it. Capturing the crown is only the beginning: the carrier can lose it under attack.</p></div><div><h3>Taking a turn</h3><p>Select a piece. A green dot marks a legal move; a red outline marks an attack. Tap the destination to move. The top bar shows the active team and remaining rounds. The side panel shows the crown owner and the number of pieces left. Each action has a ten-second limit.</p></div></div><h3>What each piece does</h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Piece</th><th>Move</th><th>Attack and crown</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Pawn</th><td>One square in any of eight directions</td><td>Can attack adjacent pawns, queens, and crown carriers. Normally claims the center crown.</td></tr><tr><th>Knight</th><td>Up to two squares in any direction</td><td>Captures pawns and knights. Normally cannot claim the crown or attack a queen.</td></tr><tr><th>Queen</th><td>Up to two squares in any direction</td><td>Demotes a crown carrier to a knight or a knight to a pawn. Moves onto the target square while the demoted piece moves to a nearby empty square.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"note\">A crown carrier cannot attack pawns, but can capture knights and queens. When a queen demotes a carrier, the crown returns to the center or the nearest empty square if the center is occupied.</p><h3>One-use character abilities</h3><ul><li><strong>Gimyo:</strong> Doubles a pawn or knight move and jumps over enemies twice per game. A pawn still attacks only an adjacent square.</li><li><strong>Keuda:</strong> Lets one pawn attack adjacent enemies in succession once per game.</li><li><strong>Yi:</strong> Swaps one of your pieces with your pawn once per game.</li><li><strong>Ho:</strong> Sacrifices the queen to let a knight claim the crown once per game.</li></ul><p>Hidden blessings near the center grant an extra turn or add a pawn. A team holding the crown cannot collect a blessing, so the item remains on its square.</p><a class=\"play\" href=\"/floor\">Play Floor Breaker →</a></section>\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"guide\"><h2>Questions players ask</h2><details><summary>Do I need to install anything?</summary><p>All three games open in a browser. Pot Breaker RE and Ginkgo Tree Breaker download their game engine on first load, so the first start can take longer.</p></details><details><summary>Can I play online with friends?</summary><p>Floor Breaker offers AI play and four-player play on one device. Online matchmaking is not available.</p></details><details><summary>Is my name put on a leaderboard automatically?</summary><p>Ranking submission in Pot Breaker RE and Ginkgo Tree Breaker is a choice on the result screen. See the <a href=\"/en/privacy\">privacy and advertising notice</a> for data details.</p></details></section>\n</main><footer>CBZP · POT BREAKER · <a href=\"/en/privacy\">Privacy &amp; ads</a></footer></body></html>", "ja": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"ja\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"ポットブレイカー RE、ギンコツリーブレイカー、フロアブレイカーの操作と勝利条件を説明します。\"><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/ja/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ko\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/en/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ja\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/ja/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/zh/about\"><title>ゲームガイドと操作方法 | CBZP POT BREAKER</title><style>\n:root{font-family:system-ui,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;color:#29365c;background:#d9efff}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;line-height:1.65;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#d3edff,#fff8e7 60%,#e5f4ff)}\na{color:#27518d}a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #cb7930;outline-offset:3px}\n.top{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px clamp(12px,4vw,40px);background:#fffaf0;border-bottom:3px solid #405879}\n.brand{font-weight:950;text-decoration:none;color:#243b65;letter-spacing:.04em}.top nav,.languages{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.top nav a,.languages a{padding:5px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:#e8f3ff;text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:800}.languages a[aria-current]{background:#ffd875}\nmain{max-width:1020px;margin:auto;padding:24px clamp(14px,4vw,32px) 60px}.intro{padding:clamp(20px,5vw,42px);border:3px solid #405b8b;border-radius:22px;background:#fffaf0;box-shadow:0 7px 0 #8a9fbd}.eyebrow{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#a34d4f}\nh1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.2rem);line-height:1.15;margin:.1em 0 .35em}h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);line-height:1.25;margin:0}h3{margin:1.2em 0 .35em;font-size:1.12rem}p{margin:.5em 0 1em}.intro p:last-child{font-size:1.1rem;max-width:760px}\n.jump{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin:22px 0}.jump a{padding:9px 15px;background:#fff;border:2px solid #5476aa;border-radius:99px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:850}\n.guide{scroll-margin-top:18px;margin:22px 0;padding:clamp(18px,4vw,32px);background:#fffdf8;border:2px solid #8da8cd;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 5px 0 #9db5d455}.section-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:2px solid #d9e4f1}.section-head p{margin:.3em 0 0;color:#435477}.num{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#ffdb7b;border:2px solid #415482;font-weight:950}\n.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.two>div{padding:2px 15px;border-radius:13px;background:#f0f6ff}.two h3{margin-top:.6em}ol,ul{padding-left:1.4em}li{margin:.38em 0}.note{padding:11px 14px;border-left:5px solid #d9a857;background:#fff2d3}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:540px}th,td{padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #afc3da;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}thead{background:#dcecff}tbody th{background:#f2f7ff;white-space:nowrap}.play{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;padding:11px 17px;border:2px solid #4b5d83;border-radius:13px;background:#ffd879;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #8295b2;color:#213456;text-decoration:none;font-weight:950}\ndetails{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d4dfec}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:850}details p{padding-left:14px}footer{padding:22px;text-align:center;background:#c4e4fa;color:#31466e}\n@media(max-width:700px){.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.top{align-items:flex-start}.top nav{width:100%}.top nav a{padding:4px 8px}.guide{padding:17px}.section-head{align-items:flex-start}}\n</style></head><body><div class=\"top\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/ja\">♟ CBZP · POT BREAKER</a><nav aria-label=\"Site\"><a href=\"/ja\">ゲームへ</a><a href=\"/ja/about\" aria-current=\"page\">遊び方</a><a href=\"/ja/privacy\">プライバシー・広告</a></nav><div class=\"languages\" aria-label=\"Languages\"><a href=\"/about\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</a> <a href=\"/en/about\" lang=\"en\">English</a> <a href=\"/ja/about\" aria-current=\"page\" lang=\"ja\">日本語</a> <a href=\"/zh/about\" lang=\"zh\">中文</a></div></div><main>\n<header class=\"intro\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">CBZP · POT BREAKER</p><h1>ゲームガイドと操作方法</h1><p>同じキャラクターが登場する3つのゲームですが、目的も操作も異なります。初めて遊ぶときは、ゲームを選び、勝利条件から確認してください。</p></header>\n<nav class=\"jump\" aria-label=\"ゲーム別ガイド\"><a href=\"#pot\">ポットブレイカー RE</a><a href=\"#ginkgo\">ギンコツリーブレイカー</a><a href=\"#floor\">フロアブレイカー</a><a href=\"#faq\">よくある質問</a></nav>\n<section id=\"pot\" class=\"guide\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><div><h2>ポットブレイカー RE</h2><p>キミョを動かし、オフィスの迷路でクダ部長と対決します。</p></div></div><div class=\"two\"><div><h3>開始と操作</h3><p>難易度を選んでオフィスに入ります。パソコンでは方向キーまたはWASDで移動し、Spaceで植木鉢を投げ、Shiftで3マスのダッシュを行います。ダッシュの再使用には3秒かかります。タッチ画面では方向・投げる・ダッシュのボタンを使い、方向ボタンを押し続けると連続して移動します。</p></div><div><h3>画面の見方</h3><p>左側にキミョの体力と植木鉢の数、右側にクダ部長の状態が表示されます。投げる前に残数を確認しましょう。オフィスのパーティションは通路を遮るため、相手が近くに見えても直進できるとは限りません。</p></div></div><h3>最初の一戦で意識すること</h3><ol><li>行き止まりに入る前に、戻れる通路を探します。</li><li>攻撃できる方向が開くまでは距離を保ち、開いたときに植木鉢を投げます。</li><li>ダッシュを使う前に、進む先に障害物がないか確認します。</li></ol><p class=\"note\">勝敗はゲーム中の体力と攻撃結果で決まります。難易度によって相手の行動が変わるため、現在のゲーム画面を優先してください。</p><a class=\"play\" href=\"/ja\">ポットブレイカー RE を遊ぶ →</a></section>\n<section id=\"ginkgo\" class=\"guide\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><div><h2>ギンコツリーブレイカー</h2><p>60秒以内に銀杏の実を選び、得点を集める反応ゲームです。</p></div></div><div class=\"two\"><div><h3>何を選ぶ？</h3><p>黄色い銀杏の実を指でタップするか、マウスでクリックします。続けて正解するとコンボが続きます。葉を選ぶとコンボが切れ、腐った実を選ぶとしばらく入力できません。動いているものをすべて押さず、現在のマスの見た目を確認してください。</p></div><div><h3>時間と難易度</h3><p>一回の制限時間は60秒です。NORMAL、HARD、VERY HARDから選べます。終了後には得点と最高コンボが表示され、結果画面からランキング登録を選択できます。難しい設定では、速さよりも実と葉の見分け方が重要です。</p></div></div><h3>安定して得点する順番</h3><ol><li>黄色い実の位置を確認してから押します。</li><li>葉と腐った実を避けてコンボを保ちます。</li><li>入力が止まったら連打せず、次の実が見えるまで待ちます。</li></ol><a class=\"play\" href=\"/ginkgo/ja\">ギンコツリーブレイカーを遊ぶ →</a></section>\n<section id=\"floor\" class=\"guide\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><div><h2>フロアブレイカー</h2><p>11×11の盤で4陣営が中央の王を争う乱闘チェスです。</p></div></div><p>各陣営はポーン6個、ナイト3個、クイーン1個で開始します。先手はランダムで、1ターンに動かす駒は1個です。AI3陣営との対戦、または同じ端末を使う4人対戦ができます。オンラインマッチングはありません。</p><div class=\"two\"><div><h3>勝利条件</h3><p>中央の王は通常ポーンで確保します。30周が終わったときに王を持つ陣営が勝利します。その時点で王に持ち主がいなければ、誰かが確保するまで延長します。王を取った後も、持つ駒が攻撃されると失うため守る必要があります。</p></div><div><h3>ターンの進め方</h3><p>自分の駒を選ぶと、移動可能なマスには緑の点、攻撃可能なマスには赤い枠が表示されます。行き先を押すとターンが進みます。上部には現在の手番と残りの周回、横には王の持ち主と残り駒数が表示されます。行動制限は10秒です。</p></div></div><h3>駒の役割</h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>駒</th><th>移動</th><th>攻撃と王</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>ポーン</th><td>8方向に1マス</td><td>隣接するポーン・クイーン・王の保持者を攻撃できます。中央の王を取る基本の駒です。</td></tr><tr><th>ナイト</th><td>8方向に最大2マス</td><td>ポーンとナイトを取れます。通常は王を取れず、クイーンも攻撃できません。</td></tr><tr><th>クイーン</th><td>8方向に最大2マス</td><td>王の保持者をナイトに、ナイトをポーンに降格させます。クイーンは攻撃先に進み、対象は近くの空きマスに移ります。</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"note\">王を持つ駒はポーンを攻撃できませんが、ナイトとクイーンを攻撃できます。クイーンによる降格で王は中央に戻り、中央が埋まっていれば近くの空きマスに置かれます。</p><h3>キャラクター能力</h3><ul><li><strong>キミョ：</strong>ポーンかナイトの移動を2倍にし、敵を飛び越えます。ゲーム中2回。ポーンの攻撃は隣接1マスのままです。</li><li><strong>クダ：</strong>一つのポーンで隣接する敵を連続攻撃します。1回。</li><li><strong>イー代理：</strong>自分の駒と自分のポーンの位置を交換します。1回。</li><li><strong>ホー社員：</strong>クイーンを犠牲にしてナイトに王を確保させます。1回。</li></ul><p>中央付近には追加ターンやポーン追加の加護が隠されています。王を持つ陣営は加護を受けられず、アイテムはそのマスに残ります。</p><a class=\"play\" href=\"/floor\">フロアブレイカーを遊ぶ →</a></section>\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"guide\"><h2>よくある質問</h2><details><summary>インストールは必要ですか？</summary><p>3つともブラウザーで遊べます。ポットブレイカー REとギンコツリーブレイカーは初回にゲームエンジンを読み込むため、開始まで少し時間がかかる場合があります。</p></details><details><summary>友達とオンライン対戦できますか？</summary><p>フロアブレイカーはAI対戦と同じ端末での4人対戦に対応しています。オンラインマッチングはありません。</p></details><details><summary>名前は自動的にランキングへ登録されますか？</summary><p>ポットブレイカー REとギンコツリーブレイカーでは、結果画面で登録を選びます。データと広告については<a href=\"/ja/privacy\">プライバシー・広告の案内</a>をご覧ください。</p></details></section>\n</main><footer>CBZP · POT BREAKER · <a href=\"/ja/privacy\">プライバシー・広告</a></footer></body></html>", "zh": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"介绍 POT BREAKER RE、银杏树破坏者和地板破坏者的操作、计分与获胜规则。\"><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/zh/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ko\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/en/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ja\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/ja/about\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://potbreaker.com/zh/about\"><title>游戏指南与操作方法 | CBZP POT BREAKER</title><style>\n:root{font-family:system-ui,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;color:#29365c;background:#d9efff}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;line-height:1.65;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#d3edff,#fff8e7 60%,#e5f4ff)}\na{color:#27518d}a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #cb7930;outline-offset:3px}\n.top{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px clamp(12px,4vw,40px);background:#fffaf0;border-bottom:3px solid #405879}\n.brand{font-weight:950;text-decoration:none;color:#243b65;letter-spacing:.04em}.top nav,.languages{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.top nav a,.languages a{padding:5px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:#e8f3ff;text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:800}.languages a[aria-current]{background:#ffd875}\nmain{max-width:1020px;margin:auto;padding:24px clamp(14px,4vw,32px) 60px}.intro{padding:clamp(20px,5vw,42px);border:3px solid #405b8b;border-radius:22px;background:#fffaf0;box-shadow:0 7px 0 #8a9fbd}.eyebrow{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#a34d4f}\nh1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.2rem);line-height:1.15;margin:.1em 0 .35em}h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);line-height:1.25;margin:0}h3{margin:1.2em 0 .35em;font-size:1.12rem}p{margin:.5em 0 1em}.intro p:last-child{font-size:1.1rem;max-width:760px}\n.jump{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin:22px 0}.jump a{padding:9px 15px;background:#fff;border:2px solid #5476aa;border-radius:99px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:850}\n.guide{scroll-margin-top:18px;margin:22px 0;padding:clamp(18px,4vw,32px);background:#fffdf8;border:2px solid #8da8cd;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 5px 0 #9db5d455}.section-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:2px solid #d9e4f1}.section-head p{margin:.3em 0 0;color:#435477}.num{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#ffdb7b;border:2px solid #415482;font-weight:950}\n.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.two>div{padding:2px 15px;border-radius:13px;background:#f0f6ff}.two h3{margin-top:.6em}ol,ul{padding-left:1.4em}li{margin:.38em 0}.note{padding:11px 14px;border-left:5px solid #d9a857;background:#fff2d3}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:540px}th,td{padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #afc3da;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}thead{background:#dcecff}tbody th{background:#f2f7ff;white-space:nowrap}.play{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;padding:11px 17px;border:2px solid #4b5d83;border-radius:13px;background:#ffd879;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #8295b2;color:#213456;text-decoration:none;font-weight:950}\ndetails{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d4dfec}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:850}details p{padding-left:14px}footer{padding:22px;text-align:center;background:#c4e4fa;color:#31466e}\n@media(max-width:700px){.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.top{align-items:flex-start}.top nav{width:100%}.top nav a{padding:4px 8px}.guide{padding:17px}.section-head{align-items:flex-start}}\n</style></head><body><div class=\"top\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/zh\">♟ CBZP · POT BREAKER</a><nav aria-label=\"Site\"><a href=\"/zh\">返回游戏</a><a href=\"/zh/about\" aria-current=\"page\">玩法指南</a><a href=\"/zh/privacy\">隐私与广告</a></nav><div class=\"languages\" aria-label=\"Languages\"><a href=\"/about\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</a> <a href=\"/en/about\" lang=\"en\">English</a> <a href=\"/ja/about\" lang=\"ja\">日本語</a> <a href=\"/zh/about\" aria-current=\"page\" lang=\"zh\">中文</a></div></div><main>\n<header class=\"intro\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">CBZP · POT BREAKER</p><h1>游戏指南与操作方法</h1><p>三款游戏使用同一组角色，但目标和操作各不相同。初次游玩时，先选游戏，再确认胜利条件和画面提示。</p></header>\n<nav class=\"jump\" aria-label=\"游戏指南目录\"><a href=\"#pot\">POT BREAKER RE</a><a href=\"#ginkgo\">银杏树破坏者</a><a href=\"#floor\">地板破坏者</a><a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a></nav>\n<section id=\"pot\" class=\"guide\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><div><h2>POT BREAKER RE</h2><p>操纵奇妙穿过办公室迷宫，与克达部长对战。</p></div></div><div class=\"two\"><div><h3>开始与操作</h3><p>选择难度后进入办公室。电脑上使用方向键或WASD移动，按Space投掷花盆，按Shift冲刺3格。冲刺后需等待3秒才能再次使用。触屏设备会显示方向、投掷和冲刺按钮；按住方向按钮可以连续移动。</p></div><div><h3>看懂画面</h3><p>左侧显示奇妙的生命值与剩余花盆，右侧显示克达部长的状态。投掷前先看剩余数量。办公室隔板会挡住道路，因此看起来很近的对手也未必能直线接近。</p></div></div><h3>第一局可以这样尝试</h3><ol><li>接近对手之前，先找一条可以退回的通路。</li><li>保持距离，在攻击方向畅通时投掷花盆。</li><li>进入死角前确认冲刺的出口，不要只看对手位置。</li></ol><p class=\"note\">胜负由游戏中的生命值与攻击结果决定。不同难度下对手行为可能变化，请以游戏画面的实时提示为准。</p><a class=\"play\" href=\"/zh\">开始 POT BREAKER RE →</a></section>\n<section id=\"ginkgo\" class=\"guide\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><div><h2>银杏树破坏者</h2><p>在60秒内找出银杏果，争取更高分数的反应游戏。</p></div></div><div class=\"two\"><div><h3>应该点击什么？</h3><p>用手指点按或鼠标点击黄色银杏果。连续选对可维持连击。点到叶子会中断连击，点到腐烂的果实则会短暂锁定输入。不要盲目点击所有移动的格子，先看清当前图案。</p></div><div><h3>时间与难度</h3><p>每局限时60秒，可选择NORMAL、HARD或VERY HARD。结束时会显示得分与最高连击记录。是否提交排行榜，由玩家在结果画面自行选择。高难度下，辨认果实和叶子比盲目加快点击更重要。</p></div></div><h3>稳定得分的顺序</h3><ol><li>确认黄色果实的位置后再点击。</li><li>避开叶子和腐烂果实，维持连击。</li><li>输入被锁定时停止连点，等待下一个明确目标。</li></ol><a class=\"play\" href=\"/ginkgo/zh\">开始银杏树破坏者 →</a></section>\n<section id=\"floor\" class=\"guide\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><div><h2>地板破坏者</h2><p>四支队伍在11×11棋盘上争夺中央王冠。</p></div></div><p>每队以6个兵、3个骑士和1个后开局。先手随机决定，每回合只移动一枚棋子。可以与三名AI对战，也可以让四名玩家共用一台设备轮流行动。暂不支持在线匹配。</p><div class=\"two\"><div><h3>如何获胜</h3><p>通常由兵夺取棋盘中央的中立王冠。完成30轮时，持有王冠的队伍获胜。如果此时王冠无人持有，就延长到有人夺冠。拿到王冠后仍需防守：持冠棋子受到攻击可能失去王冠。</p></div><div><h3>一回合怎么走</h3><p>选择己方棋子后，绿色圆点表示可移动的格子，红色边框表示可攻击的格子。点击目标格完成行动。顶部显示当前队伍和剩余轮数，侧边栏显示王冠归属和剩余棋子。每次行动限时10秒。</p></div></div><h3>棋子规则</h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>棋子</th><th>移动</th><th>攻击与王冠</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>兵</th><td>八个方向各1格</td><td>可攻击相邻的兵、后和持冠棋子。通常只有兵能夺取中央王冠。</td></tr><tr><th>骑士</th><td>八个方向最多2格</td><td>可吃兵和骑士。通常不能夺冠，也不能攻击后。</td></tr><tr><th>后</th><td>八个方向最多2格</td><td>把持冠棋子降为骑士，或把骑士降为兵。后进入目标格，被降级的棋子移至附近空格。</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"note\">持冠棋子不能攻击兵，但能攻击骑士和后。被后降级时王冠返回中央；若中央被占，则放到附近空格。</p><h3>角色能力</h3><ul><li><strong>奇妙：</strong>让兵或骑士的移动距离翻倍并越过敌棋，每局可用两次。兵的攻击仍只限相邻1格。</li><li><strong>克达：</strong>让一个兵连续攻击相邻敌棋，每局一次。</li><li><strong>李代理：</strong>交换己方一枚棋子与己方兵的位置，每局一次。</li><li><strong>虎职员：</strong>牺牲后，让骑士夺取王冠，每局一次。</li></ul><p>中央附近藏有额外回合或新增兵的祝福道具。持冠队伍不能领取祝福，道具会留在原格。</p><a class=\"play\" href=\"/floor\">开始地板破坏者 →</a></section>\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"guide\"><h2>常见问题</h2><details><summary>需要安装游戏吗？</summary><p>三款游戏都能在浏览器中打开。POT BREAKER RE和银杏树破坏者首次启动时需要加载游戏引擎，可能稍等片刻。</p></details><details><summary>能和朋友在线对战吗？</summary><p>地板破坏者支持AI对战或同设备四人轮流游戏，不提供在线匹配。</p></details><details><summary>我的名字会自动上榜吗？</summary><p>POT BREAKER RE和银杏树破坏者的排行榜提交由玩家在结果画面选择。数据与广告说明见<a href=\"/zh/privacy\">隐私与广告页面</a>。</p></details></section>\n</main><footer>CBZP · POT BREAKER · <a href=\"/zh/privacy\">隐私与广告</a></footer></body></html>"};
